<title>JAPAN: Dlr rises to 1.8048 marks, highest since Aug 1991.</title>
<headline>Dlr rises to 1.8048 marks, highest since Aug 1991.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar rose to 1.8048 marks in late Tokyo trade on Tuesday, its highest level since August 1991, on a wave of speculative dollar buying in the late afternoon, dealers said.</p>
<p>Possible stop-loss purchases were triggered at 1.8010 marks and then 1.8030 marks, they added. Earlier, there was talk of dollar purchases by U.S. players and Asian central banks.</p>
<p>--- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8584</p>
